#### 3. Счетчики статистики
```javascript
function animateCounter(element, target) {
  let current = 0;
  const increment = target / 50;
  const timer = setInterval(() => {
    current += increment;
    if (current >= target) {
      current = target;
      clearInterval(timer);
    }
    element.textContent = Math.floor(current);
  }, 30);
}
```

